WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700
- As someone that has to
work out as for a job,

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.510
I promise you I would not look like this

00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:07.980
unless I had to be naked in
most of my movies, mostly.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.500
And like at some point I
gotta get better at acting

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:11.931
so I don't have to be
naked and all of them.

00:00:11.931 --> 00:00:13.741
(laughing)
- Oh my god.

00:00:13.741 --> 00:00:14.760
- But she is just incredible.

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:19.760
I really, I mean, I literally
get to work out as a job

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:23.070
and it is, it's still hard.

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:27.140
And I can't imagine people
that have a nine to five job,

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:29.720
have kids at home and then
where do they get the energy

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:32.410
and the time to to
actually like, you know,

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:33.370
focus on themselves.

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:35.930
And I just think it's really
beautiful what she's doing.

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:37.600
- Absolutely and you get it, you're a dad.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:39.680
It's like there's a lot of
time, like just for work.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:40.540
And then you're a dad.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:41.560
It's like, it's a lot.

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:43.403
Like to fit everything in.

00:00:43.403 --> 00:00:46.510
So do you, do you do
like massive cheat days?

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:48.760
'Cause Dwayne Johnson was on here

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:50.530
and he showed me his
cheat day and I was like,

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:53.020
first of all I would barf if I ate

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:55.460
all the things he ate on his cheat day.

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:57.054
But do you have massive ones?

00:00:57.054 --> 00:01:01.460
- I sometimes do, not like
not like massive ones.

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:02.560
'Cause I think as I'm getting older,

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:04.650
it's really getting, like
everything I pick up,

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:06.850
I just go, oh that's like two more miles

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:08.120
that I have to run or ride.
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:10.420
And it's like, I just started looking

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:12.930
at things like they're just actual miles

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:14.720
and time that I have to work out.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:17.140
So I will pick the days

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:18.410
and I will pick very specific things.

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:21.070
I love cake but, but yeah.
- Oh my god, me too.

00:01:21.070 --> 00:01:21.903
(Channing laughing)

